  "bodyText": "Skip to content\nSAVOR\nSHOP\nABOUT\nRECIPES\nTotal items in cart: 0\n\nSAVOR EVERY. LAST. BITE.\n\nShop sauces →\nThe Original\nCHOOSE\n\nTHE ORIGINAL\n\n$9.49 CAD\n\nBold, fresh and filled with umami flavor\n\nSweet Pineapple\nCHOOSE\n\nSWEET PINEAPPLE\n\n$9.49 CAD\n\nThe perfect hit of tropical brightness\n\nRoasted Garlic\nCHOOSE\n\nROASTED GARLIC\n\n$9.49 CAD\n\nMade for the garlic obsessed\n\nHella Hot\nCHOOSE\n\nHELLA HOT\n\n$9.49 CAD\n\nYour tastebuds will rejoice—they will also cry\n\nOriginal\nCHOOSE\n\nORIGINAL\n\n$9.99 CAD\n\nCreamy, Savory, and Umami Flavor\n\nSweet & Spicy\nCHOOSE\n\nSWEET & SPICY\n\n$9.99 CAD\n\nCreamy, Savory, and Umami with a Kick\n\nPLAY VIDEO\nA FAMILY TRADITION OF BOLD, FRESH FLAVOR\n\nFood has the power to connect generations – whether it’s learning grandma’s recipes and trying to make them just like her or the intense memories triggered by the flavors and aromas of our childhood.\n\nSHOP\nBarbecue\nDipping\nGifts\nMerch\nASK\nShipping\nReturns\nFAQ\nAbout us\nCONNECT\nContact us\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nWE SEND TASTY EMAILS\nEmail\n© 2026 Savor, Powered by Shopify"
